abstract: "SQL-backed machine learning pipeline for diabetes risk screening on the Pima Indians Diabetes dataset: PostgreSQL cleaning layers, tuned models, a recall-targeted screening threshold, Docker Compose and tests. A research prototype, not a diagnostic tool."
